            "title": "Product",
            "description": "<p>All of our designers have been carefully selected not only for their creations, but also for their ethical and sustainable practices.</p><p>Garments are produced local to each designer, promoting local manufacturing and communities, by hand and to order.</p><p>Many of our designers use sustainable fabrics - please enquire for further information.</p><p>Many of the designs we carry are created with the intention of the garment being re-worn outside of the wedding - for another part of the celebration, on honeymoon or incorporated into your daily wardrobe.</p>"
