        "heading": "Sustainability",
        "intro_text": "<p>The nature of made-to-order bridal wear is inherently sustainable in that it is not mass produced and therefore waste-free, however at The Fall we are committed to wider sustainable initiatives. We live with the awareness that everything is connected — all of our choices have an impact, and every action reverberates. As a company, we work to keep our imprint small and our practices circular, defined by the respectful use of both materials and human resources.</p><p>Below we've listed some of the ways that we are striving to reduce our environmental impact, if you have any suggestions we are more than open to hearing about them - please get in touch.</p>"
